      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1270290800849843626, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1270290800849843626, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcName
      value: Bastien
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLine
      value: 'I''m like those little crystals: if I''m given a letter, I carry it.
        But if I''m given two at once, I get all mixed up and end up not delivering
        either one!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondLine
      value: And I never change a single letter, you know! Whatever I'm given, I
        deliver it just as it is. Bastien's an honest guy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: solvedLine
      value: All the lights have been delivered! Even I couldn't have done better.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8441010988262084743, guid: 3d3247895cca89e4aa2f689d0e05f18b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: planetCenter
